Draw in the raging fires and envelop yourself in them. Remove all burns from enemies in a radius of 5 around you, and create a shield lasting [3, 4, 5, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns with a power of [152, 205, 246, 281, 311 (TL1-5; SP 100)], increased by 15% for each burn removed.

When the shield ends, it releases a burst of fire in a radius of [2, 3, 4, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] around you, burning all enemies for 3 turns, doing damage equal to the initial power of the shield.
